  "The .atlastemplate will be moved to the trash. Existing statblock notes that reference its ID may no longer find their Atlas template. No notes will be deleted.": { en: "The .atlastemplate will be moved to the trash. Existing statblock notes that reference its ID may no longer find their Atlas template. No notes will be deleted.", "pt-BR": "O .atlastemplate ser\xE1 movido para a lixeira. Notas de statblock que referenciam seu ID talvez n\xE3o encontrem mais o template no Atlas. Nenhuma nota ser\xE1 exclu\xEDda." },
